{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31416","headline":"上元三首 一 · 韦蟾","name":"上元三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新正圆月夜，尤重看灯时。\n累塔嫌沙细，成文讶笔迟。\n归牛疑燧落，过鴈悞书迟。\n生惜兰膏烬，还爲隔岁期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}